HST Office: VBA syntax that stopped whole modules from compiling.

One compile error stops every macro of a project, so these came first in the measurement on real files:
- Function F() As Long(), Property Get P() As Double(): array return types.
- Output, Binary, Random, Access, Read, Base, Compare, Explicit as names: VBA reserves them only inside
  their statements.
- Implements in worksheet, workbook and form modules, not only in class modules.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/vba-corpus/regression_cases.py (compile cases).
---
--- a/basic/source/comp/dim.cxx
+++ b/basic/source/comp/dim.cxx
@@ -1029,7 +1029,15 @@
         }
     }
     TypeDecl( *pDef );
-    if( eType != SbxVARIANT && pDef->GetType() != eType )
+    // HST: Function F() As Long(): VBA returns an array, which a Variant holds here
+    if( bVBASupportOn && pDef->IsDefinedAs() && Peek() == LPAREN )
+    {
+        Next();
+        TestToken( RPAREN );
+        pDef->SetTypeId( 0 );
+        pDef->SetType( SbxVARIANT );
+    }
+    else if( eType != SbxVARIANT && pDef->GetType() != eType )
     {
         Error( ERRCODE_BASIC_BAD_DECLARATION, aName );
     }
